1_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ddJ5Z1ZY6HMQ7kNvwEYIZbW&_nc_oc=Adkwi6LzlyD0zL-mTt75IDv_8UaPbekaiRor9cwgQCFssrp2yTOjmJkh-FgzTMmV1o8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz6CeYyzdQPXU_PBbJSq1mReSxVvVRRUeAKArHC08cpBg&oe=69B41ED2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape.png", "id": "1246961292499404", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1246961295832737_6945312466061911653_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KqQm8w3XQQYQ7kNvwGB1zWQ&_nc_oc=Adkp1UAnCHDNhxTsV-_BkKwhZtTx2IaY2-xKVTbB2KjsPfTYAcMcBmE8yItzjNPRCsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxs0NyPcxKPvtHVJeERpFAMyT-_9hHni41fou8Nk8RmlQ&oe=69B3F5C5"}, "display_name": "World Flight", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Fly around the world without limits with your Meta Quest 2 headset.\n\nFeel the freedom, travel anywhere in the planet and enjoy all its beauty and diversity.\n\nFeatures:\n- Plan your flight on the map with a powerful search engine\n- Fly a plane or a helicopter with totally different gameplays\n- Dynamic weather, wind and time of day \n- Procedurally generated buildings and water with real data\n- Enjoy some of the most famous landmarks\n- Fully interactive cockpits\n- Manage fuel, wind, flaps, landing gear and brakes\n- Take off and land at any airport/heliport in the world", "short_description": "Fly around the world without limits with your Meta Quest 2 headset.\n\nFeel the freedom, travel anywhere in the planet and enjoy all its beauty and diversity.\n\n- Plan your flight on the map with a powerful search engine\n- Fly a plane or a helicopter with totally different gameplays\n- Dynamic weather, wind and time of day \n- Procedurally generated buildings and water with real data\n- Enjoy some of the most famous landmarks\n- Fully interactive cockpits\n- Manage fuel, wind, flaps, landing gear... etc"}]}, "developer_name": null,